00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:56.210
The word for "drifted" is the exact same one the Japanese used to describe

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:58.610
"convergence" in other dialogues.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:02.150
Therefore, it's possible that the Lothric Knights,

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:06.240
seated upon their wyverns, were this fire-breathing

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:09.166
defense force against that convergence,

00:13:09.166 --> 00:13:13.080
conquering any kingdoms that would begin to converge,

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:16.620
infringe, or drift upon the space of their own.

